# 统一行尾：仓库里一律 LF，检出时按平台自动转换。
# 之前 public/app.js、public/style.css 等文件在 Windows 上被写成 CRLF，
# 导致 git diff 显示"改了 16000 行"（实际只改了几十行），评审与回滚都不可读。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不要做行尾转换（否则会损坏内容 / 造成假 diff）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.db-shm binary
*.db-wal binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.dat binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.exe binary
